Third-party notices
-------------------

The MCP (Model Context Protocol) JSON-RPC wire format implemented in
lib/mcp-client.js follows the public specification
(https://modelcontextprotocol.io). No MCP SDK code is bundled or copied: the
client is an independent implementation written for this project.

The JSON-Schema subset normalizer in lib/schema.js mirrors the keyword
restrictions enforced by the DSH ToolRuntime at runtime. It contains no code
from that project; the keyword list and validation rules are facts about a
public interface.

